ening**, with preserved ability to do usual tasks but only with difficulty. You also report **dizziness, headaches, poor sleep, unintentional weight loss, and black stools**. From your stored health record, there is relevant background of **hypertension**, **CKD stage 2**, and prior evidence of **worsening blood pressure/kidney risk**, but the new symptom of **black stools** is the most important immediate finding because it can fit **gastrointestinal bleeding**.\n\n**Preliminary interpretation**\nThe combination of **fatigue + dizziness + weight loss + black stools** raises concern for **blood loss/anemia from possible upper GI bleeding**, which can become serious and would explain several of your symptoms better than genetics or chronic blood pressure issues alone. Other possibilities still exist — including **poor sleep**, **blood pressure-related symptoms**, or a broader medical cause of weight loss — but **black stools is a red-flag feature** and should be treated as the priority until proven otherwise.\n\n**Immediate safety note**\nIf the stools are truly **black/tarry**, or if you have **fainting, chest pain, shortness of breath, vomiting blood, marked weakness, rapid heartbeat, or worsening dizziness**, you should seek **urgent emergency medical assessment now**.\n\n**Next step**\nBefore I forward this to the Doctor Agent for a more formal diagnostic interpretation, do you want to also **upload your HRV data from your smartwatch**? That could help add recovery/autonomic context, but I want to be clear that it would **not replace urgent assessment** if the black stools are real and ongoing.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0201feecf37c61400169d8da601ef0819180a064ed8ed1535f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":366,"output":457,"cacheRead":21248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22071,"cost":{"input":0.0009150000000000001,"output":0.006855,"cacheRead":0.005312,"cacheWrite"